LLWHENCE(1)                    ZOAU Command Syntax                   LLWHENCE(1)

NAME

	llwhence - Find the dataset in the linklist that a module comes from.

SYNOPSIS

	llwhence [-dhv] <MODULE_NAME>

	-d
		Print out debug messages.

	-h
		Display syntax help.

	-v
		Print out verbose command information.

DESCRIPTION

	Search the linklist for a specified load module, and display the dataset
	it comes from.

EXAMPLES

	llwhence adm8501

EXIT VALUES

	0
		llwhence completed successfully.

	Other
		Error, see message for details.
